{"v":4,"catch":"第999幀畫面之外究竟藏著什麼！？","desc":"《SCION》是SEIBU KAIHATSU於1984年推出的射擊遊戲。\n遊戲舞台設定於水晶天堂——一座層疊交錯的龐大超級都市。\n你的使命是解救被囚禁於城市核心的親族。\n從高層向下奮戰，逐層突破敵陣，直搗深藏地底的敵方要塞！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-10-30","genres":["街機","射擊"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/99dd1e91cade63eedfa9c59979dfbf7aaeae3991e5b133281e46d990cc30f9ee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e7935ffa41c784de85b90641248ce0cfc88315634b0aac25afc41312a666a61f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4e13e3d7590deb2057da16ecfbb3412c33acff995ecdc7cc260288627328d4b7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/df845998db732dc1659e5d03ac0c5b65de879b03946f12370f7be3a3a673306d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d9fbd382b761d23eea39bb1afe5a253f572ad08bdfe2c5e21f10751e57a0f6cf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/382053f1f734fc80a8e05d06f69a9661639c3ac100ed597002efc0d9a47f3d5f.jpg"],"titleId":"0100bc6025082000","dlc":[]}